icios para la salud cardiovascular, especialmente en la dieta mediterránea.", "CARNES PROCESADAS:CARNES PROCESADAS se refiere a productos cárnicos que han sido modificados con el fin de mejorar su conservación y sabor. Sin embargo, el consumo de carnes procesadas ha sido objeto de preocupación debido a su asociación con un mayor riesgo cardiovascular. Además, se ha discutido su posible vínculo con el cáncer en el contexto de las recomendaciones dietéticas. Estas consideraciones resaltan la importancia de evaluar el consumo de carnes procesadas en la dieta, dado su impacto potencial en la salud.", "LACTEOS:LACTEOS refers to dairy products, which include items such as milk, cheese, and yogurt. These products are considered neutral in their effect on cardiovascular risk. They are recommended for patients, with a suggested intake of one serving per day, preferably in a semi-skimmed form. Additionally, LACTEOS have a high phosphorus to protein ratio, which necessitates monitoring in patients with hyperphosphatemia and chronic kidney disease.", "MORTALIDAD ECV:La mortalidad por enfermedad cardiovascular (ECV) se refiere a las muertes causadas por condiciones cardiovasculares, y se relaciona con factores de riesgo como la dieta.", "SOY PROTEIN:Soy protein is recognized for its health benefits, including its antioxidant properties and role in reducing cardiovascular risk.", "FRUITS AND VEGETABLES:Fruits and vegetables are recommended for their high content of vitamins, minerals, and antioxidants that promote heart health.", "CAROTENOS:Carotenoids are pigments found in fruits and vegetables that have antioxidant properties and may influence health.", "ENSALADAS:Ensaladas are salads made from various vegetables and fruits, often consumed for their health benefits.", "AGUACATES:Aguacates are avocados, rich in healthy fats and nutrients, commonly used in various dishes.", "DATILES:Datiles, also known as dates, are a sweet fruit that is high in fiber and nutrients. They provide 2 mg of iron per 100 grams, making them a nutritious addition to the diet. Often used in desserts, datiles are appreciated for their natural sweetness and health benefits.", "HIGOS SECOS:Higos secos are dried figs, recognized for their natural sweetness and numerous health benefits. They are classified as a type of dried fruit and are recommended as part of a low-sodium diet, highlighting their nutritional value and versatility in various dietary plans.", "CIRUELAS SECAS:CIRUELAS SECAS, known as prunes, are a type of dried fruit that are often consumed for their digestive benefits. They are also recommended as part of a low-sodium diet, highlighting their nutritional value and versatility in various dietary plans."], "parameters": {"model": "text-embedding-3-small", "temperature": 0.0, "frequency_penalty": null, "presence_penalty": null, "top_p": 1.0, "max_tokens": 4000, "n": 1}, "history": null}